# Operator-supplied values for the prod-rwo overlay.
#
# This file is COMMITTED to the operator's fork (not gitignored) — the
# GitOps source of truth for environment-specific, non-sensitive values.
# Sealed secrets live separately under ./secrets/; this file is for
# domain / URL / public-config overrides.
#
# Replace CHANGEME.example.org with your tracker's real domain. The
# same domain string is also patched into the ingress-traefik
# Component's IngressRoute (Host header) and Certificate (dnsNames) —
# see the operator workflow in ./README.md.

APP_URL=https://CHANGEME.example.org
